---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import GuaranteeBookingBand from '../../components/GuaranteeBookingBand.astro';
import site from '../../content/site.json';
import { services } from '../../lib/services';

const title = `Carpet & Upholstery Cleaning in Winona, MN | ${site.name}`;
const description = `${site.ownerName} of ${site.name} is based right in Winona, MN — carpet, rug, and upholstery cleaning for homes near Lake Winona, downtown, and Sugar Loaf.`;
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="hero">
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Areas', href: '/areas' }, { label: 'Winona, MN' }]} />
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">Serving Winona, MN</div>
      <h1>Cleaning the town <span class="accent">I grew up in.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Winona's home base for {site.name} — the van's parked here, and most weeks I'm cleaning somewhere
        between the lake and the bluffs.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Fragment>

  <section class="container prose-section">
    <p>
      Winona sits on a bend of the Mississippi between the river and the bluffs, and that geography shapes
      a lot of the work I do here. Homes near the lake and the historic downtown — a lot of them built
      long before central air was standard — tend to have older hardwood with area rugs on top rather than
      wall-to-wall carpet, so a good chunk of my Winona jobs are rug and floor work: testing a rug's fiber
      before I touch it, working carefully around original woodwork, and treating the kind of ground-in
      soil that comes from a century of foot traffic.
    </p>
    <p>
      Closer to Winona State and the newer neighborhoods on the east and south sides, it's a different mix
      — full carpet in bedrooms and living rooms, more pet stains, more move-in and move-out cleanings
      between semesters. Either way, because I live here, I'm usually not driving far to get to you, which
      means more flexibility on scheduling and faster turnaround if something comes up last-minute.
    </p>
    <p>
      Whatever your house looks like — a bluffside bungalow, a lake-view rental, or something newer out by
      the highway — the approach is the same: an honest look at what you've got, a firm price before I
      start, and I don't leave until it's right.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container services-section">
    <h2>Services in Winona</h2>
    <ul class="service-list">
      {services.map((service) => (
        <li>
          <a href={`/services/${service.route}`}>{service.navLabel}</a>
          <span class="desc">{service.homeDescription}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <GuaranteeBookingBand ctaHeadline="Ready to book in Winona?" />
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 640px;
    padding: 28px 0 0;
  }

  .hero-copy h1 {
    font-size: var(--ff-size-h1);
    line-height: 1.03;
    margin: 18px 0 20px;
    letter-spacing: var(--ff-tracking-display);
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: var(--ff-size-lead);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ff-text-body);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .prose-section {
    padding: 64px var(--ff-gutter);
    max-width: 760px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .prose-section p {
    font-size: var(--ff-size-body-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ff-text-body);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .services-section {
    padding: 0 var(--ff-gutter) 72px;
  }

  .services-section h2 {
    font-size: var(--ff-size-h2);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .service-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .service-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ff-border-line);
  }

  .service-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .service-list a {
    font-weight: var(--ff-weight-bold);
    color: var(--ff-navy);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: var(--ff-size-body);
  }

  .service-list a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .desc {
    font-size: var(--ff-size-body-sm);
    color: var(--ff-text-muted);
  }
</style>
